name: ['Barrage Tyrant', 'Blight Herder', 'Defiant Bloodlord', 'Drowner of Hope', 'Hero of Goma Fada', 'Oran-Rief Hydra', 'Radiant Flames', 'Ruinous Path', 'Scythe Leopard', 'Stasis Snare']
